{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": "Gun Game tiers and rules (data, not code). Airframe keys and presets line up with liveries/gungame/ladder.json, which owns the heat colours and which paint each airframe wears. `label` is what the HUD shows. `name` is resolved against geofs.aircraftList at load (exact, then a unique case-insensitive substring); `id_hint` is the probe-recorded id, used only to warn on a mismatch. start_kt / start_throttle: the leg-start velocity and throttle after the swap. cap_kt: the governor in fallback mode (GUNGAME_REAL_SWAP=false), where every tier flies `fallback.base`. fallback_model: the joke model shown in fallback mode. `effects`: extra effects-engine records (cap_pct only, as in upgrades.json).",
